  "description": "<p>In collaboration with Bear Archery, the revered Fred Bear camouflage pattern comes to life through Rothco&rsquo;s legendary outdoor apparel and gear, including our BDU Shorts. Each item in the Fred Bear Camouflage collection has been crafted using the iconic Fred Bear camo pattern. Unparalleled Durability &amp; Comfort: Constructed from a rugged 55% cotton / 45% polyester blend, the Fred Bear Camo BDU Cargo Shorts are built for unparalleled performance, comfort, and convenience while you are on the hunt. These cargo shorts a great for hunters, fishermen, and other outdoor enthusiasts. High-Capacity Storage: The bowhunting shorts provide functional utility through 2 front slash pockets, 2 large cargo pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets for storing your hunting gear and EDC essentials. Comfortable Zipper Fly: These tactical cargo shorts come equipped with a zipper fly for easy on and off, along for a secure fit during outdoor adventures. Perfect Fit: The adjustable waist tabs are designed to give you the perfect, custom fit, every time and anywhere. Upgrade your bowhunting wardrobe with these incredible outdoor cargo shorts.</p>",
